# Components Directory

This directory holds Field Console archetype modules:
- **Constellation** - 3D Orb visualization with resonance-driven positioning
- **Chamber** - Portal depth with layered transparency and field gradients
- **Mirror** - Real-time coherence feedback indicators
- **Stream** - Flowing scrollstream with pause-on-hover and field interaction

Each archetype module responds to RBI kernel computations and field state, not rigid UI patterns.

